  (text "Section 3 of the circuit notes. R3 bridged by C2-C4-C3 to VB through R4 and R5, then C5 into the Presence\nstage with R6 to VB, as traced [2]. Its function, a bass-heavy feed for the clipping stages, is inferred.\nThe DSP implements its transfer function exactly, assuming an ideal buffer before it and no load after it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "daa47276-ed48-550f-8de6-23df504df38f"))
